{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_186_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，王正月，舍中軍。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"貴復正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"二、楚殺其大夫屈申。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"三、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"四、夏，莒牟夷以牟婁及防、茲來奔。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"以者，不以者也。來奔者，不言出。及防、茲，以大及小也。莒無大夫，其曰牟夷何也？以其地來也。以其地來，則何以書也？重地也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"六、戊辰，叔弓帥師敗莒於賁泉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"狄人謂賁泉失台，號從中國，名從主人。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"七、秦伯卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_186_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_186","textTraditional":"八、冬，楚子、蔡侯、陳侯、許男、頓子、沈子、徐人、越人伐吳。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}